<template><el-dialog title="备件TOC计划草稿" :visible="visible" @close="$emit('close')" append-to-body width="94%" top="4vh"><div v-loading="loading"><p>先选择本次申请所需备件并确认数量；TOC结果是采购优先权重系数，不是采购数量。</p><el-alert v-if="(data.items||[]).some(r=>r.is_demo)" title="带【演示】的备件及成本均为模拟数据，不得与正式数据混作采购依据。" type="warning" :closable="false"/><p>统计期间：{{data.start}} 至 {{data.end}} · CNY</p><el-button @click="load">重新读取分类与历史</el-button><el-date-picker v-model="needed" value-format="yyyy-MM-dd" placeholder="需求日期"/><el-button type="primary" :disabled="selection.length<2" @click="showRanking=true">采购排序（已选 {{selection.length}} 项）</el-button><el-table :data="data.items||[]" border max-height="360" @selection-change="onSelection"><el-table-column type="selection" width="45"/><el-table-column label="物料编码" min-width="140"><template slot-scope="s"><el-button type="text" @click="detail=s.row">{{s.row.material_code}}</el-button></template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="material_name" label="备件"/><el-table-column label="分类"><template slot-scope="s">{{s.row.classification.abc}}/{{s.row.classification.ved}}/{{s.row.classification.fsn}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="unit_toc" label="历史单位TOC"/><el-table-column prop="order_count" label="历史订单数"/><el-table-column prop="status" label="数据状况" min-width="190"/><el-table-column label="申请数量（需确认）" width="180"><template slot-scope="s"><el-input-number v-model="s.row.reference_quantity" :min="0" :precision="0" size="small"/></template></el-table-column></el-table><p>数量必须由需求、库存、在途和安全储备共同确认；零历史不能解释为无需储备。</p><template v-if="showRanking&&selection.length>=2"><h3>本次采购备件TOC排序</h3><ExplainableChart :option="chart" title="本次备件采购优先权重" interpretation="柱形越高表示该备件在本次已选候选集合中的采购优先级越高。所有已选备件的权重系数合计为100%，它表示排序占比，不是采购数量。" principle="系统综合历史需求强度、单位TOC以及ABC价值、VED关键性、FSN流动性分类得分，再仅在本次所选备件中归一化。"/><el-table :data="selectedRanking" border><el-table-column prop="material_code" label="物料编码"/><el-table-column prop="material_name" label="备件"/><el-table-column prop="toc_weight_coefficient" label="TOC采购优先权重系数 %"/><el-table-column prop="unit_toc" label="历史单位TOC"/></el-table></template></div><el-dialog title="备件TOC权重与DOE过程" :visible="!!detail" @close="detail=null" append-to-body width="92%"><template v-if="detail"><h3>{{detail.material_name}}</h3><p>历史单位TOC：{{detail.unit_toc}}；采购金额：{{detail.history_amount}}；有效成本来源批次：{{detail.batch_ids.length}}。本页不进行同组排序，选择多个备件后请点击“采购排序”。</p><DoeAnalysis :key="detail.material_code" :material="detail.material_code" fingerprint="spare-classification-doe-v2" response-label="采购优先权重响应" design-kind="three_level" :default-runs="30" :default-factors="spareDoeFactors"/></template></el-dialog><span slot="footer"><el-button @click="$emit('close')">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" :disabled="!selection.length" @click="apply">确认并带回申请</el-button></span></el-dialog></template>
<script>
import DoeAnalysis from "./DoeAnalysis.vue";import {api} from '../api/client';import ExplainableChart from './ExplainableChart.vue';
export default {components:{ExplainableChart,DoeAnalysis},props:{visible:Boolean},data:()=>({detail:null,data:{},loading:false,selection:[],needed:null,showRanking:false,spareDoeFactors:[{name:'ABC价值等级（C=1/B=2/A=3）',low:1,high:3},{name:'VED关键性等级（D=1/E=2/V=3）',low:1,high:3},{name:'FSN流动性等级（N=1/S=2/F=3）',low:1,high:3}]}),watch:{visible(v){if(v)this.load();}},computed:{selectedRanking(){const total=this.selection.reduce((n,r)=>n+(r.score||0),0);return this.selection.map(r=>({...r,toc_weight_coefficient:r.score!==null&&total?Number((r.score/total*100).toFixed(4)):null})).sort((a,b)=>(b.toc_weight_coefficient||0)-(a.toc_weight_coefficient||0));},chart(){return {title:{text:'本次采购备件TOC优先权重系数'},tooltip:{trigger:'axis'},grid:{left:60,right:20,bottom:70},xAxis:{type:'category',data:this.selectedRanking.map(r=>r.material_code),axisLabel:{rotate:25}},yAxis:{type:'value',name:'权重系数 %'},series:[{type:'bar',data:this.selectedRanking.map(r=>r.toc_weight_coefficient)}]};}},methods:{onSelection(rows){this.selection=rows;this.showRanking=false;},async load(){this.loading=true;this.selection=[];this.showRanking=false;try{this.data=(await api.get('/spare-plans/ranking')).data;}catch(e){this.$message.error(e.response?.data?.detail||'分析失败');}finally{this.loading=false;}},apply(){if(!this.needed||this.selection.some(r=>!r.reference_quantity))return this.$message.warning('请确认需求日期及所有选中物料的正数数量');const ranks=this.selectedRanking;this.$emit('apply',{needed_date:this.needed,lines:this.selection.map(r=>({material_code:r.material_code,material_name:r.material_name,specification:r.specification,unit:r.unit,quantity:r.reference_quantity,estimated_unit_price:r.estimated_unit_price})),summary:'备件TOC采购优先排序 '+this.data.policy+'；统计期 '+this.data.start+'~'+this.data.end+'；'+ranks.map(r=>r.material_code+' 权重系数 '+(r.toc_weight_coefficient??'数据不足')+'%').join('；')});}}};
</script>
